  "Description": {
    "Cost": 11734155,
    "UIName": "Haze",
    "Id": "chassisdef_haze_HAZ-Prime",
    "Name": "Haze",
    "Details": "The Prime configuration of the Haze, the Society's successor to the Phantom as a carrier for Magnetic Clamp-equipped ProtoMechs, puts a much greater emphasis on long-range combat than its predecessor. An ER Large Laser in the right arm and three LRM-5 launchers deliver its firepower at range, while a Nova CEWS, a Light TAG and a Micro Pulse Laser in the torso cover electronic warfare, target designation and close defense.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Sensors</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "Haze"
  },
